{%- comment -%}
  The Black Friday deals sold only with a discount code: a heading and a sideways row of cards
  in the look of the page's posters, each with its code on a coupon, the limited-stock note
  and the normal add to cart. Used by sections/alc-bf-code-deals (homepage) and
  sections/alc-black-friday (between the hero and the posters). Both load
  assets/alc-bf-code-deals.css and .js and sit inside a ".alc-of.alc-bf" stage.

  Accepts:
  - deals: {Array} blocks with the settings product, code and reduction
  - section_id: {String}
  - units: {Number} how many units of each product the code gives, for the texts

  A native code has one fixed value, so the card can't read its price from it: the block holds
  the same reduction as the code, in bani of the shop's currency (35000 = 350,00 lei), and the
  card shows product.price minus that. A price changed in Base moves both alike.

  Abroad the code takes the same lei at the day's rate. Liquid has no exchange rate, so the
  first paint converts with the approximate ones below and the script corrects it to
  Shopify.currency.rate, rounding as the cart does.

  A product out of stock, or with the metafield custom.bf_code_exhausted set (Liquid can't read
  a code's usage), goes to the end of the row, greyed out, without its code.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign lang = request.locale.iso_code | downcase | slice: 0, 2
  case lang
    when 'en'
      assign w = 'Super prices,|with a code only|Limited stock: only {n} pcs of each product at these prices. The code is applied automatically when you add the product to the cart.|with code|Limited stock: only {n} pcs at this price|Copy code|Code copied|Sold out at this price|You save|Previous|Next|Code {code} has run out. The product stays in your cart at the regular price.|An order can use at most 5 codes. This product stays in your cart at the regular price.'
    when 'hu'
      assign w = 'Szuperárak,|csak kóddal|Korlátozott készlet: termékenként csak {n} db ezen az áron. A kód automatikusan érvényesül, amikor a terméket a kosárba teszi.|kóddal|Korlátozott készlet: csak {n} db ezen az áron|Kód másolása|Kód másolva|Ezen az áron elfogyott|Megtakarítás:|Előző|Következő|A(z) {code} kód elfogyott. A termék a normál áron marad a kosárban.|Egy rendeléshez legfeljebb 5 kód használható. Ez a termék a normál áron marad a kosárban.'
    when 'pl'
      assign w = 'Super ceny,|tylko z kodem|Ograniczona ilość: tylko {n} szt. każdego produktu w tych cenach. Kod zostanie zastosowany automatycznie po dodaniu produktu do koszyka.|z kodem|Ograniczona ilość: tylko {n} szt. w tej cenie|Kopiuj kod|Kod skopiowany|Wyprzedane w tej cenie|Oszczędzasz|Wstecz|Dalej|Kod {code} został wyczerpany. Produkt pozostaje w koszyku w zwykłej cenie.|W jednym zamówieniu można użyć maksymalnie 5 kodów. Ten produkt pozostaje w koszyku w zwykłej cenie.'
    when 'el'
      assign w = 'Σούπερ τιμές,|μόνο με κωδικό|Περιορισμένο απόθεμα: μόνο {n} τεμ. από κάθε προϊόν σε αυτές τις τιμές. Ο κωδικός εφαρμόζεται αυτόματα όταν προσθέτετε το προϊόν στο καλάθι.|με κωδικό|Περιορισμένο απόθεμα: μόνο {n} τεμ. σε αυτή την τιμή|Αντιγραφή κωδικού|Ο κωδικός αντιγράφηκε|Εξαντλήθηκε σε αυτή την τιμή|Κερδίζετε|Προηγούμενα|Επόμενα|Ο κωδικός {code} εξαντλήθηκε. Το προϊόν παραμένει στο καλάθι στην κανονική τιμή.|Σε κάθε παραγγελία μπορούν να χρησιμοποιηθούν έως 5 κωδικοί. Το προϊόν παραμένει στο καλάθι στην κανονική τιμή.'
    when 'bg'
      assign w = 'Супер цени,|само с код|Ограничено количество: само по {n} бр. от всеки продукт на тези цени. Кодът се прилага автоматично, когато добавите продукта в количката.|с код|Ограничено количество: само {n} бр. на тази цена|Копирай кода|Кодът е копиран|Изчерпано на тази цена|Спестявате|Назад|Напред|Код {code} е изчерпан. Продуктът остава в количката на редовна цена.|В една поръчка могат да се използват най-много 5 кода. Този продукт остава в количката на редовна цена.'
    when 'it'
      assign w = 'Super prezzi,|solo con codice|Disponibilità limitata: solo {n} pz per ogni prodotto a questi prezzi. Il codice si applica da solo quando aggiungi il prodotto al carrello.|con codice|Disponibilità limitata: solo {n} pz a questo prezzo|Copia il codice|Codice copiato|Esaurito a questo prezzo|Risparmi|Precedenti|Successivi|Il codice {code} è esaurito. Il prodotto resta nel carrello al prezzo normale.|In un ordine puoi usare al massimo 5 codici. Questo prodotto resta nel carrello al prezzo normale.'
    when 'fr'
      assign w = 'Super prix,|uniquement avec un code|Stock limité : seulement {n} pièces de chaque produit à ces prix. Le code s’applique automatiquement lorsque vous ajoutez le produit au panier.|avec le code|Stock limité : seulement {n} pièces à ce prix|Copier le code|Code copié|Épuisé à ce prix|Vous économisez|Précédent|Suivant|Le code {code} est épuisé. Le produit reste dans le panier au prix normal.|Une commande accepte 5 codes au maximum. Ce produit reste dans le panier au prix normal.'
    when 'cs'
      assign w = 'Super ceny,|jen s kódem|Omezené zásoby: jen {n} ks od každého produktu za tyto ceny. Kód se použije automaticky, když produkt přidáte do košíku.|s kódem|Omezené zásoby: jen {n} ks za tuto cenu|Zkopírovat kód|Kód zkopírován|Za tuto cenu vyprodáno|Ušetříte|Předchozí|Další|Kód {code} je vyčerpán. Produkt zůstává v košíku za běžnou cenu.|V jedné objednávce lze použít nejvýše 5 kódů. Tento produkt zůstává v košíku za běžnou cenu.'
    when 'sk'
      assign w = 'Super ceny,|len s kódom|Obmedzené zásoby: len {n} ks z každého produktu za tieto ceny. Kód sa použije automaticky, keď produkt pridáte do košíka.|s kódom|Obmedzené zásoby: len {n} ks za túto cenu|Skopírovať kód|Kód skopírovaný|Za túto cenu vypredané|Ušetríte|Predchádzajúce|Ďalšie|Kód {code} je vyčerpaný. Produkt zostáva v košíku za bežnú cenu.|V jednej objednávke možno použiť najviac 5 kódov. Tento produkt zostáva v košíku za bežnú cenu.'
    when 'hr'
      assign w = 'Super cijene,|samo s kodom|Ograničene zalihe: samo {n} kom. svakog proizvoda po ovim cijenama. Kod se primjenjuje automatski kada proizvod dodate u košaricu.|s kodom|Ograničene zalihe: samo {n} kom. po ovoj cijeni|Kopiraj kod|Kod je kopiran|Rasprodano po ovoj cijeni|Uštedite|Prethodno|Sljedeće|Kod {code} je iskorišten. Proizvod ostaje u košarici po redovnoj cijeni.|U jednoj narudžbi možete upotrijebiti najviše 5 kodova. Ovaj proizvod ostaje u košarici po redovnoj cijeni.'
    when 'de'
      assign w = 'Superpreise,|nur mit Code|Begrenzter Vorrat: nur {n} Stück pro Produkt zu diesen Preisen. Der Code wird automatisch angewendet, wenn Sie das Produkt in den Warenkorb legen.|mit Code|Begrenzter Vorrat: nur {n} Stück zu diesem Preis|Code kopieren|Code kopiert|Zu diesem Preis ausverkauft|Sie sparen|Zurück|Weiter|Der Code {code} ist aufgebraucht. Das Produkt bleibt zum regulären Preis im Warenkorb.|Pro Bestellung können höchstens 5 Codes verwendet werden. Dieses Produkt bleibt zum regulären Preis im Warenkorb.'
    when 'nl'
      assign w = 'Superprijzen,|alleen met code|Beperkte voorraad: slechts {n} stuks per product voor deze prijzen. De code wordt automatisch toegepast wanneer u het product aan de winkelwagen toevoegt.|met code|Beperkte voorraad: slechts {n} stuks voor deze prijs|Code kopiëren|Code gekopieerd|Uitverkocht voor deze prijs|U bespaart|Vorige|Volgende|Code {code} is op. Het product blijft in uw winkelwagen tegen de normale prijs.|Per bestelling kunt u maximaal 5 codes gebruiken. Dit product blijft in uw winkelwagen tegen de normale prijs.'
    else
      assign w = 'Prețuri super,|doar cu cod|Stoc limitat: doar câte {n} buc. din fiecare produs la aceste prețuri. Codul se aplică singur când adaugi produsul în coș.|cu codul|Stoc limitat: doar {n} buc. la acest preț|Copiază codul|Cod copiat|Epuizat la acest preț|Economisești|Înapoi|Înainte|Codul {code} s-a epuizat. Produsul a rămas în coș la prețul normal.|Poți folosi cel mult 5 coduri pe o comandă. Produsul a rămas în coș la prețul normal.'
  endcase
  assign t = w | split: '|'

  comment
    Literal tokens inside an output tag would close it early, so they are built.
  endcomment
  assign n_token = '{' | append: 'n' | append: '}'
  assign code_token = '{' | append: 'code' | append: '}'
  assign units_text = units | default: 20 | append: ''
  assign sub_text = t[2] | replace: n_token, units_text
  assign limit_text = t[4] | replace: n_token, units_text

  comment
    Lei to the market's currency, approximate: see the note at the top.
  endcomment
  assign rate = 0
  case cart.currency.iso_code
    when 'RON'
      assign rate = 1
    when 'HUF'
      assign rate = 69.75
    when 'EUR'
      assign rate = 0.18728
    when 'PLN'
      assign rate = 0.84
    when 'CZK'
      assign rate = 4.653
  endcase

  assign valid_deals = 0
  for deal in deals
    if deal.settings.product != blank and deal.settings.code != blank and deal.settings.reduction > 0
      assign valid_deals = valid_deals | plus: 1
    endif
  endfor

  assign money_sample = 1234500 | money
  assign img_widths = '300, 450, 600'
  assign img_sizes = '(min-width: 1100px) 300px, (min-width: 750px) 36vw, 72vw'
  assign deal_position = 0
-%}
{%- if valid_deals > 0 -%}
  <section class="alc-bfcd" id="AlcBfCodeDeals" aria-labelledby="AlcBfCdTitle-{{ section_id }}" data-money-sample="{{ money_sample | escape }}">
    <alc-bf-scroller class="alc-bfcd__scroller">
      <div class="alc-bfcd__head">
        <div class="alc-bfcd__heading">
          <h2 class="alc-bf__h2 alc-bfcd__title" id="AlcBfCdTitle-{{ section_id }}">
            <span>{{ t[0] }}</span> <span class="alc-bf__gold">{{ t[1] }}</span>
          </h2>
          <p class="alc-bf__sub alc-bfcd__sub">{{ sub_text }}</p>
        </div>
        <div class="alc-bfcd__tools">
          <button type="button" class="alc-bf__arrow" data-prev aria-label="{{ t[9] | escape }}" disabled>
            <svg aria-hidden="true" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m15 6-6 6 6 6"/></svg>
          </button>
          <button type="button" class="alc-bf__arrow" data-next aria-label="{{ t[10] | escape }}">
            <svg aria-hidden="true" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m9 6 6 6-6 6"/></svg>
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <ul class="alc-bfcd__track" role="list" data-track>
        {%- comment -%} Two passes: the deals still on first, the exhausted ones after them. {%- endcomment -%}
        {%- for pass in (1..2) -%}
          {%- for deal in deals -%}
            {%- liquid
              assign product = deal.settings.product
              assign code = deal.settings.code | strip
              assign reduction = deal.settings.reduction | plus: 0
              if product == blank or code == blank or reduction <= 0
                continue
              endif

              assign is_out = false
              unless product.available
                assign is_out = true
              endunless
              if product.metafields.custom.bf_code_exhausted.value
                assign is_out = true
              endif
              if pass == 1 and is_out
                continue
              endif
              if pass == 2 and is_out == false
                continue
              endif

              assign reduction_local = reduction | times: rate | floor
              if reduction_local >= product.price
                continue
              endif

              assign variant = product.selected_or_first_available_variant
              assign price_now = product.price | minus: reduction_local
              assign pct = reduction_local | times: 100.0 | divided_by: product.price | round
              assign form_id = 'bf-code-' | append: section_id | append: '-' | append: product.id
              assign title_id = 'BfCodeTitle-' | append: section_id | append: '-' | append: product.id
              assign refused_text = t[11] | replace: code_token, code

              assign money_now = price_now | money
              assign money_was = product.price | money
              if settings.currency_code_enabled
                assign money_now = price_now | money_with_currency
                assign money_was = product.price | money_with_currency
              endif

              comment
                The price cut at its decimal separator, as in snippets/alc-bf-poster.
              endcomment
              assign cents = price_now | modulo: 100 | plus: 100 | append: '' | slice: 1, 2
              assign whole = money_now
              assign sep = ''
              assign tail = ''
              for candidate in (1..2)
                if candidate == 1
                  assign try_sep = ','
                else
                  assign try_sep = '.'
                endif
                assign token = try_sep | append: cents
                unless money_now contains token
                  continue
                endunless
                assign cut = money_now | split: token
                assign after = cut[1] | default: ''
                assign after_digits = after | remove: '0' | remove: '1' | remove: '2' | remove: '3' | remove: '4' | remove: '5' | remove: '6' | remove: '7' | remove: '8' | remove: '9'
                if after_digits == after and cut.size < 3
                  assign whole = cut[0]
                  assign sep = try_sep
                  assign tail = after | strip
                  break
                endif
              endfor
              if sep == ''
                assign last_word = money_now | split: ' ' | last
                assign last_digits = last_word | remove: '0' | remove: '1' | remove: '2' | remove: '3' | remove: '4' | remove: '5' | remove: '6' | remove: '7' | remove: '8' | remove: '9'
                if last_digits == last_word and last_word != money_now
                  assign whole = money_now | remove_last: last_word | strip
                  assign tail = last_word
                endif
              endif
            -%}
            <li class="alc-bfcd__item" {{ deal.shopify_attributes }}>
              <alc-code-deal
                class="alc-bfcd__deal{% if is_out %} is-out{% endif %}"
                data-code="{{ code | escape }}"
                data-reduction="{{ reduction }}"
                data-price="{{ product.price }}"
                data-variant-id="{{ variant.id }}"
                data-refused="{{ refused_text | escape }}"
                data-no-place="{{ t[12] | escape }}"
              >
                <article class="alc-bf__card" style="--alc-bf-i: {{ deal_position | modulo: 4 }};">
                  <a class="alc-bf__card-media" href="{{ product.url }}" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">
                    <span class="alc-bf__niche">
                      {%- if product.featured_media != blank -%}
                        {{
                          product.featured_media
                          | image_url: width: 600
                          | image_tag:
                            widths: img_widths,
                            sizes: img_sizes,
                            loading: 'lazy',
                            alt: '',
                            class: 'alc-bf__niche-img'
                        }}
                      {%- endif -%}
                    </span>
                    {%- unless is_out -%}
                      <span class="alc-bf__seal"><span data-seal>-{{ pct }}%</span></span>
                    {%- endunless -%}
                  </a>

                  <div class="alc-bf__card-body">
                    <h3 class="alc-bf__card-title" id="{{ title_id }}">
                      <a href="{{ product.url }}">{{ product.title | escape }}</a>
                    </h3>

                    <div class="alc-bf__prices">
                      <s class="alc-bf__was">
                        <span class="visually-hidden">{{ 'products.product.price.regular_price' | t }}</span>
                        {{- money_was -}}
                      </s>
                      {%- unless is_out -%}
                        <p class="alc-bf__now">
                          <span class="visually-hidden" data-now-text>{{ 'products.product.price.sale_price' | t }} {{ money_now }}</span>
                          <span class="alc-bf__amount" aria-hidden="true" data-amount>
                            {%- if sep != '' or tail != '' -%}
                              {{- whole -}}
                              {%- if sep != '' %}<span class="alc-bf__dec"><span class="alc-bf__sep">{{ sep }}</span>{{ cents }}</span>{% endif -%}
                              {%- if tail != '' %}<span class="alc-bf__cur">{{ tail }}</span>{% endif -%}
                            {%- else -%}
                              {{- money_now -}}
                            {%- endif -%}
                          </span>
                        </p>
                        <p class="alc-bf__save">{{ t[8] }} <span data-save>{{ reduction_local | money }}</span></p>
                      {%- endunless -%}
                    </div>

                    {%- unless is_out -%}
                      <div class="alc-bfcd__coupon">
                        <span class="alc-bfcd__coupon-text">
                          <span class="alc-bfcd__with">{{ t[3] }}</span>
                          <strong class="alc-bfcd__code">{{ code | escape }}</strong>
                        </span>
                        <button type="button" class="alc-bfcd__copy" data-copy aria-label="{{ t[5] | escape }} {{ code | escape }}" data-done="{{ t[6] | escape }}">
                          <svg class="alc-bfcd__copy-icon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="9" y="9" width="11" height="11" rx="2"/><path d="M5 15H4a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h10a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v1"/></svg>
                          <svg class="alc-bfcd__copied-icon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m5 13 4.5 4.5L19 7"/></svg>
                        </button>
                        <span class="visually-hidden" role="status" data-copy-status></span>
                      </div>
                      <p class="alc-bfcd__limit">{{ limit_text }}</p>
                    {%- endunless -%}

                    <product-form class="alc-bf__form" data-section-id="{{ section_id }}">
                      {%- form 'product', product, id: form_id, class: 'form', novalidate: 'novalidate', data-type: 'add-to-cart-form' -%}
                        <input type="hidden" name="id" value="{{ variant.id }}" class="product-variant-id">
                        <button
                          id="{{ form_id }}-submit"
                          type="submit"
                          name="add"
                          class="alc-bf__buy"
                          aria-haspopup="dialog"
                          aria-labelledby="{{ form_id }}-submit {{ title_id }}"
                          aria-live="polite"
                          data-sold-out-message="true"
                          {% if is_out %}disabled{% endif %}
                        >
                          <span>{% if is_out %}{{ t[7] }}{% else %}{{ 'products.product.add_to_cart' | t }}{% endif %}</span>
                          <span class="sold-out-message hidden">{{- 'products.product.sold_out' | t -}}</span>
                          {%- unless is_out -%}
                            <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M6 7h12l1 13H5L6 7z"/><path d="M9 7a3 3 0 0 1 6 0"/></svg>
                          {%- endunless -%}
                          {%- render 'loading-spinner' -%}
                        </button>
                      {%- endform -%}
                    </product-form>

                    <p class="alc-bfcd__refused" role="status" data-refused-slot hidden></p>
                  </div>
                </article>
              </alc-code-deal>
            </li>
            {%- assign deal_position = deal_position | plus: 1 -%}
          {%- endfor -%}
        {%- endfor -%}
      </ul>
    </alc-bf-scroller>
  </section>
{%- endif -%}
